WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:05,500
Black boy, stop making trouble

2
00:00:05,980 --> 00:00:07,020
You really recognize me

3
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:09,300
Bai Zaizi is also weird

4
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:11,710
This blood is not in vain

5
00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:14,580
Both wolf cubs are stable

6
00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:19,110
Try seaweed too

7
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:21,230
They don't look scared

8
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:23,540
On the contrary, I look forward to it

9
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:26,000
It seems he knows this stuff too

10
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:27,240
They are also good

11
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:33,580
I think your parents were dying

12
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:35,620
I don’t want you to kill each other either.

13
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:37,060
Follow in their footsteps

14
00:00:38,050 --> 00:00:39,690
So please be nice to me from now on.

15
00:00:40,010 --> 00:00:41,290
If anyone is not in harmony

16
00:00:41,610 --> 00:00:43,650
Then I can only be forced to make peace with you

17
00:00:47,540 --> 00:00:49,220
Master, the four of them are

18
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:51,420
I just bought this when I went out today, waiting for me to join the army

19
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:53,420
This white wolf boy is responsible for accompanying you

20
00:00:53,420 --> 00:00:54,340
And look at the courtyard

21
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:56,220
And if this Haidongqing misses me,

22
00:00:56,340 --> 00:00:57,380
I can ask him to send me a message

23
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:00,000
Thank you, Master
